- action(n1, "start the technical support case resolution process"): Hallucinates an undocumented initial step; the source explicitly states "the first step is to set the case to the 'In progress' status."
- action(n6, "You have completed this procedure"): Hallucinates an undocumented concluding step; the source indicates the workflow terminates immediately once "the case can be set to the 'Solved' state, and that concludes the process."
- actor(a_default, "Default", [...] ): Misidentifies the responsible party; the source explicitly assigns all documented activities to "technical support staff," not a generic "Default" actor.